title Home Assistant: locks and garage covers ask first: the lock's tile (Enter on it) asks "Unlock Front door?" Yes / Cancel, then Unlocked; the entity page's Unlock asks too; the garage door's Open asks
sizes 480x320 640x480 800x480 1024x600 1280x720 1280x800 720x720 480x800 480x640 800x1280
env HA_DEMO home

wait 1600
# the entity page: its action row asks first
tap "Front door"
wait 600
shot lock-page
check lock-page
expect text "Locked"
expect text "Unlock"
key enter
wait 400
shot confirm-lock
check confirm-lock
expect text "Unlock Front door?"
expect text "Yes"
expect text "Cancel"
key esc
wait 300
expect notext "Unlock Front door?"
key esc
wait 500
# the tile's icon (keys on the deck: the focus shows, Down to the slider, Down to the lock, Enter)
@640x480 key down
@640x480 key down
@640x480 key down
@640x480 wait 300
@640x480 shot focus-lock
@640x480 key enter
@640x480 wait 400
@640x480 expect text "Unlock Front door?"
@640x480 shot confirm-tile
@640x480 key enter
@640x480 wait 900
@640x480 expect text "Unlocked"
@640x480 shot unlocked
@640x480 check unlocked
# the garage door's page: Open asks
drag 0.5 0.92 0.5 0.30
wait 300
drag 0.5 0.92 0.5 0.30
wait 300
tap "Garage door"
wait 600
expect text "Open"
expect text "Close"
key enter
wait 400
expect text "Open Garage door?"
shot confirm-garage
check confirm-garage
key esc
wait 300
expect notext "Open Garage door?"
key esc
wait 400
expect text "Favourites"
expect noquit
